/T (Greater Transparency begins with Metrics However, while progress has been made, substantial disparities remain among DBEs such as LGBTQ+, veteran-, and disabled veteran-owned businesses. To advance equity meaningfully and intentionally, insurance companies should consider utilizing  quantifiable metrics to continue benchmarking their progress with diverse suppliers. )
/E (Greater Transparency begins with Metrics However, while progress has been made, substantial disparities remain among DBEs such as LGBTQ+, veteran-, and disabled veteran-owned businesses. To advance equity meaningfully and intentionally, insurance companies should consider utilizing  quantifiable metrics to continue benchmarking their progress with diverse suppliers. )
